#: internal/cli/messages.go
msgid "Prints the completion script for bash, zsh or fish. Packages install them; to load one by hand: `source <(sona completion bash)`, `sona completion zsh > \"${fpath[1]}/_sona\"` or `sona completion fish | source`."
msgstr ""

#: internal/cli/messages.go
msgid "Prints the lyrics of the playing song, one line to a line, with a blank line between verses. With --lrc it writes an LRC file (a [mm:ss.xx] time before each line, and the title, artist and album tags) for a lyrics player; that needs lyrics with timing. With --follow it keeps running for status bars and shells such as Quickshell, Waybar and Polybar: it prints the line being sung now and another each time it changes (an empty line while the voice rests, and when there are no lyrics), until Sona quits. The lyrics come from the sources chosen in Sona's settings, as in its lyrics view."
msgstr ""

#: internal/cli/messages.go
